    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/d4a404ee84053bc78b50d96f77a2a9ac.avif?t=1603220474\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/ac3793baae0c95df320f6a52d996a9ff.avif?t=1603220474\" /></div><br>Manifold Garden is a game that reimagines physics and space.<br><br>Rediscover gravity and explore a beautiful Escher-esque world of impossible architecture. Geometry repeats infinitely in every direction, and falling down leads you back to where you started. Manipulate gravity to change your perspective and see the world in new ways. Master the rules of the universe and restore a barren world with vegetation and life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/a3e33d1e14d28b3c6317c0fb77c0c50d.poster.avif?t=1603220474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/a3e33d1e14d28b3c6317c0fb77c0c50d.webm?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/a3e33d1e14d28b3c6317c0fb77c0c50d.mp4?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/9562b1e5ba9f0831486ee9a660f4e9c4.avif?t=1603220474\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    An expansive and visually striking world filled with mind-bending puzzles.<br></li><li>    Manipulate gravity to gain new perspectives and walk on any visible surface.<br></li><li>    Explore expansive architectural structures that repeat infinitely.<br></li><li>    Capture striking and beautiful images with Photo Mode.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/18f29836242bb246be2c45b9a90c599e.poster.avif?t=1603220474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/18f29836242bb246be2c45b9a90c599e.webm?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/18f29836242bb246be2c45b9a90c599e.mp4?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Manifold Garden has been nominated for several awards, including \u201cBest Debut\u201d from the Game Developers Choice Awards and BAFTA Game Awards. It was selected as one of the New Yorker\u2019s best games of 2019.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/ac3793baae0c95df320f6a52d996a9ff.avif?t=1603220474\" /></div><br>Manifold Garden is a game that reimagines physics and space.<br><br>Rediscover gravity and explore a beautiful Escher-esque world of impossible architecture. Geometry repeats infinitely in every direction, and falling down leads you back to where you started. Manipulate gravity to change your perspective and see the world in new ways. Master the rules of the universe and restore a barren world with vegetation and life.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/a3e33d1e14d28b3c6317c0fb77c0c50d.poster.avif?t=1603220474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/a3e33d1e14d28b3c6317c0fb77c0c50d.webm?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/a3e33d1e14d28b3c6317c0fb77c0c50d.mp4?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/9562b1e5ba9f0831486ee9a660f4e9c4.avif?t=1603220474\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    An expansive and visually striking world filled with mind-bending puzzles.<br></li><li>    Manipulate gravity to gain new perspectives and walk on any visible surface.<br></li><li>    Explore expansive architectural structures that repeat infinitely.<br></li><li>    Capture striking and beautiful images with Photo Mode.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/18f29836242bb246be2c45b9a90c599e.poster.avif?t=1603220474\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/18f29836242bb246be2c45b9a90c599e.webm?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/473950/extras/18f29836242bb246be2c45b9a90c599e.mp4?t=1603220474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Manifold Garden has been nominated for several awards, including \u201cBest Debut\u201d from the Game Developers Choice Awards and BAFTA Game Awards. It was selected as one of the New Yorker\u2019s best games of 2019.",
    "short_description": "Rediscover gravity and explore an Escher-esque world of impossible architecture. Witness infinity in first-person and master its rules to solve physics-defying puzzles. Cultivate a garden to open new paths forward, where an eternal expanse awaits.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Arabic, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish",
    "reviews": "\u201cManifold Garden is a feast for the eyes and the mind...\u201d<br>[9/10] \u2013 GameSpot<br><br>\u201cA beautiful meditation on the human brain, nature, mathematics, time, space and creation.\u201d<br>[8/10] \u2013 EDGE<br><br>\u201cA serene gravity flipping puzzler with impossible structures to wrap your head around.\u201d<br>[85/100] \u2013 PC Gamer<br>",
